# ── Ferumind live workspace ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Nothing here is tracked, not even a placeholder: bootstrap creates the
# directory, and a tracked file inside it makes a fresh clone look like an
# existing workspace with no format marker, which bootstrap refuses.
/workspace/

